1
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:04,990
Morning.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,290
Mezato.

3
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:12,530
G-good morning...

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,110
Why didn't you show up yesterday?

5
00:00:18,610 --> 00:00:20,520
Morning, Mob.

6
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:23,040
Sorry, yesterday...

7
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:25,360
I just totally forgot.

8
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:27,470
You... forgot?

9
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:30,800
There was an executive meeting
the day before the assembly,

10
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:33,570
and he just showed up there.

11
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:35,980
The real founder.

12
00:00:36,090 --> 00:00:36,760
Huh?

13
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:40,950
I'm sorry for mistaking you as the founder
and dragging you into all this.

14
00:00:41,050 --> 00:00:43,020
It's okay now.

15
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:49,930
What do you mean, okay?

16
00:00:51,790 --> 00:00:53,630
What's going on?

17
00:00:57,450 --> 00:00:59,160
(MOB MOB WOW!)

18
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:02,040
(MOB MOB WOW!)

19
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:04,870
(MOB MOB WOW!)

20
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:07,710
(MOB MOB WOW!)

21
00:01:09,130 --> 00:01:11,840
I realized that our youth is grey

22
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:14,760
The origin of this uneasiness
Is yet unknown

23
00:01:14,840 --> 00:01:17,260
Trains of emotions keep running
Through my brain

24
00:01:17,260 --> 00:01:20,430
Struggling through this adolescence

25
00:01:20,550 --> 00:01:23,390
Don't disturb my deep psyche

26
00:01:23,390 --> 00:01:26,060
Who is that behind you?

27
00:01:26,190 --> 00:01:29,860
Opposing ideas creates distortion

28
00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:33,280
Exorcise all the sorrow

29
00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:36,950
So, do what you can now

30
00:01:37,030 --> 00:01:38,860
My life

31
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:42,990
Finally, break it down

32
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:47,330
(Want) Both greed
(Young) And honesty

33
00:01:47,330 --> 00:01:50,210
(Burn) Are growing
(1) On this chest of mine

34
00:01:50,210 --> 00:01:52,960
(Trance) I'm not waking up
(Chance) I want to wake up

35
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:55,920
(Stance) These two different faces of mine
(1) Are standing back-to-back

36
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:58,430
Taking things as it is

37
00:01:58,430 --> 00:02:01,850
In this free relation where
We resent each other

38
00:02:01,930 --> 00:02:04,140
Once these two become one

39
00:02:04,140 --> 00:02:06,140
That smile becomes one

40
00:02:06,140 --> 00:02:09,230
And only "1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

41
00:02:09,900 --> 00:02:12,900
"1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

42
00:02:13,230 --> 00:02:14,320
(MOB MOB WOW!)

43
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:17,190
One and only "1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

44
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:18,900
"1"

45
00:02:18,900 --> 00:02:20,070
(MOB MOB WOW!)

46
00:02:20,070 --> 00:02:22,370
One and only "1"

47
00:02:23,990 --> 00:02:28,500
(Divine Tree 1
~The Founder Appears~)

48
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:32,340
My bad, really. I totally forgot.

49
00:02:32,750 --> 00:02:36,590
I really have no idea how
I could forget at the last minute.

50
00:02:38,570 --> 00:02:42,060
Is it something related to
the Psycho Helmet Religion?

51
00:02:42,140 --> 00:02:44,620
Oh, how did you know?

52
00:02:44,620 --> 00:02:46,800
Yesterday, I was solicited
into a seminar in the city,

53
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:51,100
but once I went, I ended up more
interested in it than in space.

54
00:02:52,450 --> 00:02:55,620
Everyone, from now on,
we're no longer the Brainwave Club,

55
00:02:55,620 --> 00:02:57,990
we'll be Psycho Helmet Religion
Salt Mid Branch!

56
00:02:57,990 --> 00:02:59,830
Really?

57
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:02,740
And what do we do as that?

58
00:03:02,850 --> 00:03:05,990
We'll offer prayer to
the Psycho Helmet Club.

59
00:03:05,990 --> 00:03:08,500
They say five minutes per day
would give benefits.

60
00:03:08,500 --> 00:03:10,380
Really? Just like that?

61
00:03:11,880 --> 00:03:14,620
So, that Psycho Helmet Religion
meeting yesterday?

62
00:03:14,620 --> 00:03:18,090
The broadcast video has been watched
over two million times.

63
00:03:19,110 --> 00:03:20,180
Well?

64
00:03:20,180 --> 00:03:23,180
That's the guy that becomes their founder.
You know him?

65
00:03:23,180 --> 00:03:25,010
No, not at all.

66
00:03:27,750 --> 00:03:29,710
He has to be a psychic.

67
00:03:30,540 --> 00:03:34,010
After that, all the other groups become
part of the religion just like that.

68
00:03:34,140 --> 00:03:40,190
Unfortunately, now that he's the founder,
you can't take that position anymore.

69
00:03:41,090 --> 00:03:43,070
Oh well, whatever.

70
00:03:43,180 --> 00:03:46,270
You're not the type to do
that kind of thing, anyway.

71
00:03:46,670 --> 00:03:49,100
Anyway, you said there's something
you want to talk about.

72
00:03:49,100 --> 00:03:51,050
Oh, about that.

73
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:54,040
Pictures of buildings?

74
00:03:55,020 --> 00:03:56,840
Wow, they have big cracks.

75
00:03:56,970 --> 00:04:00,210
Mysterious structural deterioration
phenomenon.

76
00:04:00,410 --> 00:04:04,640
Once I checked the place,
it wasn't any normal structural defect.

77
00:04:04,790 --> 00:04:07,140
The cause is plant roots.

78
00:04:07,500 --> 00:04:11,640
Now that I think again,
that building was a victim of it, too.

79
00:04:12,190 --> 00:04:14,690
The roots that have appeared
all over the city

80
00:04:14,690 --> 00:04:18,550
they pierces through roads and reinforced
concrete in search of nutrients.

81
00:04:18,750 --> 00:04:21,100
I thought it was an invasive species,

82
00:04:21,100 --> 00:04:24,400
but it's actually coming from
the worst place possible.

83
00:04:24,710 --> 00:04:28,520
The culprit is none other than the
very thing taking everyone's attention.

84
00:04:29,300 --> 00:04:31,020
The Divine Tree.

85
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:33,990
-That broccoli?
-That's right!

86
00:04:33,990 --> 00:04:35,520
That means if we ignore that thing,

87
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:38,410
all our jobs will be nothing
but building investigations.

88
00:04:38,410 --> 00:04:40,270
Is it that bad?

89
00:04:40,270 --> 00:04:43,700
They take lots of effort,
but barely make money, you know.

90
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:48,480
Not to mention, we're a bit responsible
about that thing in the first place.

91
00:04:48,980 --> 00:04:50,260
Mob.

92
00:04:50,260 --> 00:04:51,860
Help me with this.

93
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:54,810
We're going to destroy that broccoli.

94
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:59,150
Okay.

95
00:05:00,010 --> 00:05:02,160
Good afternoon. Please take this.

96
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:04,280
Huh? What's this?

97
00:05:04,430 --> 00:05:07,160
It's part of the Divine Tree
that has been powdered.

98
00:05:07,260 --> 00:05:09,410
It's very good as nourishment.

99
00:05:09,640 --> 00:05:11,580
They've added new menus!

100
00:05:11,580 --> 00:05:13,560
I want to eat the Divine Tree parfait!

101
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:16,610
-It's the Divine Tree croquette!
-I heard they're giving free samples.

102
00:05:16,610 --> 00:05:20,410
I'm feeling pretty pumped ever since
I got to this Seasoning City.

103
00:05:20,730 --> 00:05:23,670
-What's that?
-Divine Tree candy, apparently.

104
00:05:24,060 --> 00:05:25,560
-Is it good?
-What flavor?

105
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:28,180
-This will be pretty good with a sauce.
-Who needs sauce for this?

106
00:05:28,850 --> 00:05:31,580
Handmade cookies, huh?

107
00:05:32,970 --> 00:05:36,390
"I've used powdered Divine Tree
that's really good for vitality."

108
00:05:36,390 --> 00:05:38,920
"Please eat some and get healthy."

109
00:05:39,580 --> 00:05:42,830
Didn't they also give out
Divine Tree powder at the station?

110
00:05:48,510 --> 00:05:49,720
Just so-so.

111
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:52,430
Probably just the usual placebo product.

112
00:05:55,500 --> 00:05:57,570
Things like this are pretty nice.

113
00:05:57,710 --> 00:06:00,240
The Divine Tree... is amazing...

114
00:06:00,380 --> 00:06:03,950
Long live... Lord Psycho Helmet...

115
00:06:07,850 --> 00:06:11,410
It's a powerful brainwashing
that takes control of emotions!

116
00:06:11,550 --> 00:06:14,030
They're handing things
mixed with this?!

117
00:06:14,030 --> 00:06:16,150
You won't get away with this!

118
00:06:16,490 --> 00:06:18,300
You've made me angry!

119
00:06:19,310 --> 00:06:23,040
The brainwash wave is emitted from
the direction of the Divine Tree.

120
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:26,240
I'll purge it and free this city!

121
00:06:29,410 --> 00:06:31,160
In here, huh?

122
00:06:31,280 --> 00:06:33,730
Sorry, but I'm opening a hole here.

123
00:06:38,380 --> 00:06:39,710
A barrier?!

124
00:06:40,960 --> 00:06:42,040
Ivies?!

125
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:53,220
Seems like you were waiting for me.

126
00:06:57,400 --> 00:06:59,480
Wait, is that you, Kageyama?

127
00:07:01,960 --> 00:07:03,920
Nah, he just looks like him.

128
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:07,230
Who are you?
What are you doing here?

129
00:07:07,390 --> 00:07:09,040
What do you mean, who?

130
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,830
I...

131
00:07:11,370 --> 00:07:13,820
...am obviously God.

132
00:07:15,430 --> 00:07:18,040
God... A true God...

133
00:07:18,270 --> 00:07:19,930
That's right...

134
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:23,820
Lord Psycho Helmet,
pardon my rudeness.

135
00:07:23,820 --> 00:07:25,970
I beg your forgiveness.

136
00:07:26,460 --> 00:07:29,890
You damaged the Divine Tree
that strengthen my existence.

137
00:07:30,460 --> 00:07:33,200
I'll let you go this time. Go home.

138
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:34,990
Thank you very much.

139
00:07:35,100 --> 00:07:38,010
Be more discipline
in your worship from now on.

140
00:07:38,010 --> 00:07:39,030
Yes...

141
00:07:39,130 --> 00:07:41,490
Worship... God...

142
00:07:41,490 --> 00:07:44,670
Psycho Helmet... Divine Tree...

143
00:07:44,730 --> 00:07:46,560
Religion...

144
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:48,320
Empty...?

145
00:07:50,130 --> 00:07:52,530
Another one that is
annoying to deal with.

146
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:56,150
How dare you!

147
00:07:59,510 --> 00:08:03,320
You didn't just try
to brainwash me once, but twice.

148
00:08:03,390 --> 00:08:07,150
That is not brainwashing,
but a blessing.

149
00:08:07,370 --> 00:08:11,380
I'm offering commoners that have nothing
and those looking for a place

150
00:08:11,380 --> 00:08:14,540
a sanctuary for their heart.

151
00:08:17,170 --> 00:08:20,310
Hey, are you trying to kill me?

152
00:08:20,610 --> 00:08:22,830
It's not like you're a human, anyway.

153
00:08:22,990 --> 00:08:24,620
That is correct.

154
00:08:24,700 --> 00:08:25,940
I am a God!

155
00:08:26,830 --> 00:08:29,920
Trying to fight God is insanity!

156
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:32,410
Rethink this again!

157
00:08:32,490 --> 00:08:34,450
Another brainwashing...?

158
00:08:34,700 --> 00:08:36,780
That's enough of you!

159
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:39,160
Your brainwashing wave.

160
00:08:39,850 --> 00:08:45,680
It forcefully raises a sense of awe
toward the Psycho Helmet Religion.

161
00:08:46,050 --> 00:08:50,090
But you won't get brainwashed if you
can push it back with strong emotion.

162
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:56,320
Here I come.

163
00:08:59,810 --> 00:09:01,770
I already had my fill

164
00:09:02,030 --> 00:09:05,070
of people that try to conquer
others with power.

165
00:09:05,180 --> 00:09:07,880
Doing that won't make you a God.

166
00:09:08,620 --> 00:09:10,360
Or even a protagonist.

167
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:13,140
That's not how you do it.

168
00:09:14,250 --> 00:09:18,020
All right, time to figure out who it is.

169
00:09:18,670 --> 00:09:19,870
Is this...?

170
00:09:28,250 --> 00:09:31,760
Minegishi, you can take a break now.

171
00:09:31,880 --> 00:09:33,000
Okay.

172
00:09:33,490 --> 00:09:35,270
-Manager.
-What is it?

173
00:09:35,270 --> 00:09:37,760
The plants are strange.

174
00:09:37,910 --> 00:09:41,330
The flowers were fine this morning,
but now they're withering.

175
00:09:42,170 --> 00:09:46,070
They're losing their vigor, as if
their life essence is being sucked dry.

176
00:09:46,200 --> 00:09:49,060
-I think we need to find the cause...
-Minegishi.

177
00:09:49,450 --> 00:09:53,470
I told you it's break time,
so take a break already.

178
00:09:55,570 --> 00:09:57,118
(Smiley Flower Arrangement)

179
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,071
Okay...
(Smiley Flower Arrangement)

180
00:09:58,800 --> 00:10:02,030
I wasn't expecting a proper job
to be this tough.

181
00:10:04,470 --> 00:10:07,170
Even the roadside weed
is getting weaker.

182
00:10:07,270 --> 00:10:09,970
Not to mention, the cracks
are larger than yesterday.

183
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:11,890
What's the cause?

184
00:10:13,270 --> 00:10:15,130
Which tree are you from?

185
00:10:17,570 --> 00:10:19,080
I see.

186
00:10:19,780 --> 00:10:21,370
The Divine Tree.

187
00:10:21,570 --> 00:10:25,700
So you're taking energy
from all the plants in the city.

188
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:29,330
The soil will die if I leave it alone.

189
00:10:29,790 --> 00:10:32,560
Good thing I noticed it early.

190
00:10:33,270 --> 00:10:35,660
You've grown too greedy.

191
00:10:35,820 --> 00:10:38,600
This is an order.
You may no longer...

192
00:10:39,380 --> 00:10:44,350
Hey, Minegishi, how much longer
are you going to take a break?

193
00:10:45,760 --> 00:10:48,000
Huh? Minegishi?

194
00:10:48,270 --> 00:10:50,580
It can't be...

195
00:10:53,340 --> 00:10:57,630
So persistent. How much longer
are you going to keep regenerating?

196
00:10:59,870 --> 00:11:02,840
You can't stop me.

197
00:11:03,580 --> 00:11:05,980
Don't you agree, Hanazawa?

198
00:11:06,430 --> 00:11:08,020
I see now...

199
00:11:08,350 --> 00:11:11,690
You really are
a good-for-nothing evil spirit.

200
00:11:11,690 --> 00:11:14,070
What are you trying to do
with that look,

201
00:11:14,190 --> 00:11:15,840
Dimple?

202
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:18,460
I used the Divine Tree's trunk
to image myself

203
00:11:18,460 --> 00:11:21,830
based on Psycho Helmet's icon.

204
00:11:22,170 --> 00:11:25,990
The followers cannot see me
in spirit form, after all.

205
00:11:26,110 --> 00:11:27,730
What's your goal?

206
00:11:27,730 --> 00:11:30,600
Does Kageyama know about
you going out of control?

207
00:11:30,670 --> 00:11:32,920
This has nothing to do with Shigeo.

208
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:35,830
My goal has always been
one and the same.

209
00:11:35,830 --> 00:11:38,760
To be a God in this modern era.

210
00:11:39,610 --> 00:11:41,560
I see, what a shame.

211
00:11:41,560 --> 00:11:43,890
I have to erase you once again.

212
00:11:44,420 --> 00:11:48,530
I'll tell Kageyama that you moved
to the afterlife peacefully.

213
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:50,860
This is goodbye!

214
00:12:03,550 --> 00:12:05,640
Don't you think something is weird?

215
00:12:06,880 --> 00:12:11,470
The atmosphere in the city.
It's as if we're being watched.

216
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:16,000
Right, you said you're getting
popular lately, aren't you?

217
00:12:16,080 --> 00:12:19,660
Everyone gets a bit too
self-conscious once in their life,

218
00:12:19,660 --> 00:12:22,170
but I suggest you don't say that out loud.

219
00:12:22,250 --> 00:12:24,700
You'll regret it in a couple of years.

220
00:12:27,970 --> 00:12:31,600
How are we going
to destroy that broccoli?

221
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:35,440
Well, I've made a plan.

222
00:12:35,540 --> 00:12:36,770
Simple enough, right?

223
00:12:37,290 --> 00:12:40,650
Um, so I have to carry it to the sea?

224
00:12:40,650 --> 00:12:44,530
Yeah. I will look out for your safety
and make sure you reach it.

225
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:46,780
This is going to be a tiring job.

226
00:12:47,470 --> 00:12:50,370
It would be great if someone can help.

227
00:12:50,760 --> 00:12:53,040
Serizawa gonna be in his night school...

228
00:12:53,040 --> 00:12:54,060
What about your brother?

229
00:12:54,140 --> 00:12:55,270
Ritsu...

230
00:12:55,270 --> 00:12:58,510
There's a student council meeting today,
so he might still be at school.

231
00:13:02,430 --> 00:13:04,260
-Ritsu.
-Hey.

232
00:13:06,990 --> 00:13:10,400
Isn't carrying that thing
a bit too much, Brother?

233
00:13:11,020 --> 00:13:14,180
I once carried a piano
together with others.

234
00:13:14,180 --> 00:13:16,110
Doing it alone would be impossible,

235
00:13:16,110 --> 00:13:18,370
but we managed to do it
by working together.

236
00:13:18,540 --> 00:13:20,520
That's why, we should be able to do it.

237
00:13:22,190 --> 00:13:24,570
Get your Divine Tree powder here.

238
00:13:24,570 --> 00:13:26,240
Take it, it's good for your health.

239
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:28,890
What's wrong?
You're not up to it?

240
00:13:28,990 --> 00:13:31,660
-No, I...
-I'm begging you, Ritsu.

241
00:13:31,740 --> 00:13:34,730
If we don't do anything, Seasoning City
might end up becoming uninhabitable.

242
00:13:34,730 --> 00:13:37,420
My mum once planted
a watermelon in her yard,

243
00:13:37,420 --> 00:13:40,200
and she said it ended up
killing all the other plants.

244
00:13:40,430 --> 00:13:43,660
Not to mention its size.
It'll immediately take all the nutrients.

245
00:13:44,550 --> 00:13:45,810
Just like that.

246
00:13:46,020 --> 00:13:50,540
Fine, fine. I get it. I'll help.

247
00:13:53,590 --> 00:13:54,840
Is something wrong?

248
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:56,960
Well, it's...

249
00:13:58,810 --> 00:14:00,780
Praying time?

250
00:14:00,930 --> 00:14:02,200
What's that supposed to be?

251
00:14:02,300 --> 00:14:07,130
Basically we're praying so that
we can live the day happily.

252
00:14:07,230 --> 00:14:10,620
What are you talking about?
Are you sane, Makihara?

253
00:14:10,780 --> 00:14:13,410
Besides, who are you praying to?

254
00:14:13,490 --> 00:14:17,870
We pray to Lord Psycho Helmet
that lives inside the Divine Tree.

255
00:14:18,930 --> 00:14:21,600
-Who agrees with me?
-Hey, Makihara...

256
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:23,760
-I agree.
-I agree.

257
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:25,090
I agree.

258
00:14:25,200 --> 00:14:28,110
Hang on, everyone!
Are you all thinking straight?!

259
00:14:28,190 --> 00:14:30,150
-This stupid thing...
-Now now,

260
00:14:30,150 --> 00:14:32,700
you don't have to reject it so hard.

261
00:14:33,360 --> 00:14:36,190
I understand new opinions
are not easy to just accept.

262
00:14:36,190 --> 00:14:37,780
Kamuro...

263
00:14:39,740 --> 00:14:42,630
Brother, do you know about
the Psycho Helmet Religion?

264
00:14:42,720 --> 00:14:45,160
Huh? Are you also interested in that?

265
00:14:45,160 --> 00:14:49,630
Of course not. But it seems like there
are a lot of their followers at school.

266
00:14:49,630 --> 00:14:52,160
I just find their spread
to be weirdly fast.

267
00:14:52,810 --> 00:14:57,910
And the thing they... worship,
I think, is the Divine Tree.

268
00:14:59,290 --> 00:15:04,840
So that means getting rid of the broccoli
would antagonize them.

269
00:15:05,310 --> 00:15:09,260
But as far as I checked,
they seemed pretty harmless.

270
00:15:09,700 --> 00:15:12,350
Selling merchandise, sharing opinions...

271
00:15:12,430 --> 00:15:15,180
Maybe less of a religion and
more of a group of hobbyists.

272
00:15:15,340 --> 00:15:19,870
Something like a group of people
with similar interests having fun.

273
00:15:20,160 --> 00:15:23,120
That's why I'm saying they're suspicious.

274
00:15:23,120 --> 00:15:25,610
Of course, we need to be careful of them.

275
00:15:25,870 --> 00:15:28,220
We might need to think
of a counter plan.

276
00:15:29,880 --> 00:15:33,240
Oh well, let's just do it quickly
and immediately run away.

277
00:15:33,350 --> 00:15:34,820
My head hurts!

278
00:15:35,620 --> 00:15:37,390
I'm going to need some sugar.

279
00:15:37,390 --> 00:15:40,320
You brought candies to school, Ritsu?

280
00:15:40,320 --> 00:15:42,070
Oh, this?

281
00:15:42,290 --> 00:15:44,760
I got these from the student
council president.

282
00:15:44,890 --> 00:15:46,480
Kageyama.

283
00:15:46,590 --> 00:15:49,400
-Take this before you go home.
-What are those?

284
00:15:49,500 --> 00:15:53,050
Apparently, it's a product made
for city promotion.

285
00:15:53,180 --> 00:15:57,520
My dad got a lot of samples
from a meeting.

286
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:01,120
-I'll take them.
-Thank you.

287
00:16:02,090 --> 00:16:03,910
Give it a try, Brother.

288
00:16:04,060 --> 00:16:05,210
Thank you.

289
00:16:05,210 --> 00:16:06,810
Have some too, Reigen.

290
00:16:06,810 --> 00:16:09,980
O-oh? I'll have it later.

291
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:11,960
Me too, I'll have it later.

292
00:16:12,220 --> 00:16:14,510
Once we finished pulling the broccoli.

293
00:16:15,540 --> 00:16:18,330
Before that,
can we go somewhere first?

294
00:16:21,720 --> 00:16:23,520
You're walking pretty fast.

295
00:16:23,820 --> 00:16:25,950
Where are we going, Ritsu?

296
00:16:27,400 --> 00:16:28,590
Ritsu?

297
00:16:28,590 --> 00:16:30,140
(Seasoning City Meeting Hall)

298
00:16:30,210 --> 00:16:31,550
It's in here.

299
00:16:31,660 --> 00:16:33,450
I'd like to introduce you
to some people.

300
00:16:33,450 --> 00:16:35,360
Isn't this the city's meeting hall?

301
00:16:42,300 --> 00:16:44,690
Who are they, Ritsu?

302
00:16:45,100 --> 00:16:47,430
They're from the Psycho Helmet Religion.

303
00:16:47,430 --> 00:16:48,460
What?

304
00:16:48,550 --> 00:16:50,970
Brother, let's rethink this again...

305
00:16:51,100 --> 00:16:52,530
W-what do you mean?

306
00:16:52,530 --> 00:16:54,690
There's no use playing dumb.

307
00:16:54,690 --> 00:16:57,400
How could you even think
about removing the Divine Tree?

308
00:16:57,530 --> 00:17:00,750
The Divine Tree enriches everyone's heart.

309
00:17:01,350 --> 00:17:03,750
This city needs the Divine Tree.

310
00:17:03,750 --> 00:17:05,030
Hang on a sec!

311
00:17:05,030 --> 00:17:07,710
When did you inform these guys?

312
00:17:07,710 --> 00:17:09,560
Ritsu, what is going on?

313
00:17:09,710 --> 00:17:13,400
I just thought that I need
to protect the Divine Tree.

314
00:17:13,710 --> 00:17:17,340
Then I had an inkling that
everyone would be here.

315
00:17:17,530 --> 00:17:21,160
And what are you planning to do
by bringing us here?

316
00:17:22,170 --> 00:17:23,920
That candy!

317
00:17:24,620 --> 00:17:27,860
Have a seat, Brother.
You too, Reigen.

318
00:17:27,940 --> 00:17:30,460
Here, we prepared some tea for you.

319
00:17:30,560 --> 00:17:32,670
You don't need to be so wary.

320
00:17:32,830 --> 00:17:35,660
Let's talk about this peacefully, okay?

321
00:17:48,910 --> 00:17:51,340
So they won't even listen for a bit...

322
00:17:54,580 --> 00:17:57,320
Do we really need to run that quickly?

323
00:17:57,320 --> 00:18:02,110
If we stayed there, we might turn
into followers via group hypnotism.

324
00:18:02,350 --> 00:18:05,700
-Take out the candy you have.
-Candy?

325
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:08,880
There's a ton of this thing
in that room.

326
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:11,570
Ritsu might've been
brainwashed by these things.

327
00:18:11,710 --> 00:18:14,430
Ritsu got brainwashed?

328
00:18:14,600 --> 00:18:16,570
I can't just leave him be.

329
00:18:18,280 --> 00:18:22,100
Calm down, I don't think
it causes any real harm yet,

330
00:18:22,100 --> 00:18:24,950
-We should proceed...
-Hey, you two!

331
00:18:25,290 --> 00:18:27,720
I suggest you don't do anything futile.

332
00:18:27,720 --> 00:18:31,800
Lord Psycho Helmet sees all.

333
00:18:34,090 --> 00:18:37,230
Mob, there's no mistaking it this time.

334
00:18:37,310 --> 00:18:39,340
We are being watched.

335
00:18:39,890 --> 00:18:43,130
Wait, what's with that shirt?
Why are you taking your jacket off?

336
00:18:43,130 --> 00:18:45,670
It's getting pretty hot from
all the running, so...

337
00:18:46,610 --> 00:18:50,350
Just put it back on,
your jacket provides defences...

338
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:54,520
You're trying to do something
to the Divine Tree, huh?

339
00:18:54,520 --> 00:18:56,580
You two can't do anything about it.

340
00:18:56,670 --> 00:18:58,640
Arataka Reigen.

341
00:18:59,100 --> 00:19:02,920
I heard you're planning
to cut down the Divine Tree.

342
00:19:02,920 --> 00:19:04,730
It seems like I need to scold you...

343
00:19:04,830 --> 00:19:07,120
Hey, they're running away!

344
00:19:07,670 --> 00:19:09,100
Dammit!

345
00:19:09,320 --> 00:19:14,130
I think most of the citizen has been
turned into Psycho Helmet followers.

346
00:19:14,310 --> 00:19:16,380
How did it end up like this?

347
00:19:16,380 --> 00:19:18,410
What should we do?

348
00:19:18,880 --> 00:19:21,800
Psycho Helmet is an unknown psychic.

349
00:19:21,870 --> 00:19:25,710
We don't even know what he's thinking,
moreover his goals.

350
00:19:25,870 --> 00:19:29,480
I'm sure he'll show up on our way
if we head to the Divine Tree.

351
00:19:29,770 --> 00:19:34,970
If he's a bad guy, take him out and
free everyone from the brainwash.

352
00:19:47,050 --> 00:19:48,330
Hey, Mob.

353
00:19:48,940 --> 00:19:51,660
What do you think about
the Psycho Helmet Religion?

354
00:19:51,820 --> 00:19:54,060
Do you think they're bad guys?

355
00:19:54,460 --> 00:19:57,870
No, I don't think they're bad people.

356
00:19:58,280 --> 00:20:02,490
They just seem like a bunch of people
having fun together.

357
00:20:03,050 --> 00:20:05,020
You think so, too?

358
00:20:05,190 --> 00:20:06,380
-I also...
-But...

359
00:20:06,460 --> 00:20:09,420
It changed once the founder showed up.

360
00:20:11,260 --> 00:20:16,580
If he's a fake and tricked everyone
into worshipping him,

361
00:20:16,830 --> 00:20:18,610
I don't like how he does things.

362
00:20:19,930 --> 00:20:21,340
But Mob,

363
00:20:21,340 --> 00:20:26,340
there's no real one to begin with.
How can you say that he's a fake?

364
00:20:26,450 --> 00:20:27,480
Huh?

365
00:20:27,660 --> 00:20:33,600
What, are you implying that
you're actually the true Psycho Helmet?

366
00:20:33,760 --> 00:20:35,070
No...

367
00:20:35,070 --> 00:20:39,440
Since the beginning, there was only
a pretence that a founder even exists.

368
00:20:39,600 --> 00:20:42,590
I don't think that
Psycho Helmet is a bad guy.

369
00:20:43,320 --> 00:20:46,320
Every community needs a leader.

370
00:20:46,560 --> 00:20:49,520
Just think of it as the leader of a fan club.
Sounds normal enough.

371
00:20:49,640 --> 00:20:54,810
He pretty much manages activity policy
and ensures smooth operation.

372
00:20:54,970 --> 00:20:56,910
Must be hard work.

373
00:20:57,010 --> 00:21:00,480
He's doing what you can't do, Mob.

374
00:21:00,720 --> 00:21:03,230
But don't hold a grudge against him.

375
00:21:03,230 --> 00:21:05,960
It's a festival.
Those who have fun win.

376
00:21:07,140 --> 00:21:12,690
If they need the Divine Tree, then
it's not good to take it from them.

377
00:21:13,710 --> 00:21:16,290
All right, let's go home for today, Mob.

378
00:21:18,330 --> 00:21:20,160
Master Reigen.

379
00:21:20,590 --> 00:21:22,540
This is just a guess,

380
00:21:22,800 --> 00:21:25,610
but are you brainwashed?

381
00:21:26,480 --> 00:21:27,890
Me?

382
00:21:28,030 --> 00:21:31,090
Oh, I see...

383
00:21:31,240 --> 00:21:37,390
So this is how it feels like, being told
you're brainwashed even if that's not true.

384
00:21:41,560 --> 00:21:45,020
Try to prioritize the citizen's hearts
over the city itself.

385
00:21:45,410 --> 00:21:49,280
Every single citizen has turned into
a follower of the Psycho Helmet Religion.

386
00:21:49,400 --> 00:21:52,190
We should consider
their feelings too, right?

387
00:21:54,120 --> 00:21:57,150
From now on, this city,
or this world,

388
00:21:57,150 --> 00:22:01,200
they need to live symbiotically with the
Divine Tree and Psycho Helmet Religion, so...

389
00:22:02,860 --> 00:22:05,550
Hey, Mob! I'm not coming with you!

390
00:22:05,550 --> 00:22:06,950
Hey!

391
00:22:07,570 --> 00:22:10,090
I hope I'm just mistaken...

392
00:22:10,940 --> 00:22:12,360
But those people...

393
00:22:12,360 --> 00:22:13,530
And those people...

394
00:22:13,530 --> 00:22:14,970
And those people...

395
00:22:15,120 --> 00:22:16,890
Even those people...

396
00:22:18,040 --> 00:22:23,220
Maybe I'm the only one
in this city that hasn't...

397
00:22:33,580 --> 00:22:35,490
Are you going to meet him?

398
00:22:35,590 --> 00:22:36,860
Yeah...

399
00:22:37,550 --> 00:22:40,710
I want to see him directly,
and ask some questions.

400
00:22:40,810 --> 00:22:42,210
Oh?

401
00:22:42,270 --> 00:22:44,390
Everyone, give him a space.

402
00:22:44,390 --> 00:22:46,460
Mob is coming through.

403
00:22:49,540 --> 00:22:52,340
I can hear Lord Psycho Helmet's voice.

404
00:22:52,500 --> 00:22:56,190
Shigeo Kageyama is the original
Lord Psycho Helmet!

405
00:22:57,640 --> 00:22:59,400
Oh, this is amazing!

406
00:22:59,400 --> 00:23:02,760
The original Lord Psycho Helmet
has returned!

407
00:23:03,570 --> 00:23:06,000
There are two Lord Psycho Helmet!

408
00:23:06,000 --> 00:23:07,620
We have a double founder!

409
00:23:07,620 --> 00:23:08,890
Yay!

410
00:23:08,890 --> 00:23:10,860
This is getting better and better!

411
00:23:12,720 --> 00:23:17,010
-What a wonderful man.
-Psycho Helmet! Psycho Helmet!

412
00:23:17,120 --> 00:23:20,000
-How admirable!
-Psycho Helmet! Psycho Helmet!

413
00:23:20,280 --> 00:23:24,880
Psycho Helmet! Psycho Helmet!
Psycho Helmet!

414
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:27,760
Now now, calm down, Mob.

415
00:23:27,760 --> 00:23:30,520
Are you really going to beat up
Lord Psycho Helmet?

416
00:23:30,520 --> 00:23:33,640
Think again carefully,
this is for your own sake, okay?

417
00:23:33,770 --> 00:23:36,030
Next on episode 5 of
Mob Psycho 100 III,

418
00:23:36,030 --> 00:23:37,390
"Divine Tree 2 ~Peace~"

419
00:23:37,490 --> 00:23:40,075
Illegal download?
You're going to get cursed.
